                        <h3>Architecture Principles</h3>
                        <p>The proposed solution shall adopt an open, modular, scalable, secure, standards-based, and
                            vendor-neutral architecture. The solution shall avoid vendor lock-in and enable seamless
                            integration, interoperability, replacement, upgrade, and future expansion of cameras, Video
                            Management Systems (VMS), analytics engines, storage platforms, AI modules, and other technology
                            components through documented standard APIs, open protocols, SDKs, and modular adapter-based
                            frameworks. The architecture should be technology-agnostic, support heterogeneous multi-vendor
                            environments, and facilitate future enhancements without requiring significant redesign of the
                            overall system.</p>
                    </section>
